.Language=English,English
.PluginContents=Resource Browser plugin

@Contents
$^#Resource Browser Plugin 1.00 Beta 5#
$^#Copyright (c) 1999-2000 Igor Pavlov#
    This FAR module allows to work with resources in executable files.
Files in the archive are handled in the same manner as if they were in a
folder.

   ~Getting resources~@ExtractResources@

   ~Resource Browser configuration~@ResourceConfig@



 Web site:  #www.7-zip.com#

 E-mail:    #support@@7-zip.com#

@ExtractResources
$ #Getting resources#
    In this dialog you may enter the path to extract files.

@ResourceConfig
$ #Resource Browser configuration#
    In this dialog you may change following parameters:

 #Plugin Enabled#         Enables / Disables plugin.
 
 #Text in Unicode#        Text will be copied in Unicode.
 